 [x] |\n| 34 | `encode_quant` | full exhaustive small grid: `uni ∈ 0..=15` × `lsbit ∈ {0,1,2,3,4,5,6,8,12,-1,-2,-4}` × `step ∈ {0,1,7,8,9,-1,-8,255,-255}` × `(pred,tgt,tgt2)` from a 6-value pool | [x] |\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
